      "comment": "PAW FARINA (1) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at Horsham three back. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. PADDY'S CHARIOT (2) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (25.61) at this track in a Grade 4/5. Key player on best and worth another try. WHERE'S MICK (6) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 7 lengths into third (22.60) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. The form from his last run stacks up well. Will give a great sight again. VACATION CALLING (3) was a shade disappointing when in the placings as favourite last start – worth including.",
